    <string name="service_summary">Two-finger swipe up or down to change volume anywhere.</string>
    <string name="service_description">Gesture Volume watches for a two-finger swipe up or down anywhere on screen and changes your media volume. It only observes touch events — it never blocks your normal taps and swipes, and it never reads screen content.</string>

